Subject: [PATCH v6 08/10] gpu: host1x: Reserve VBLANK syncpoints at initialization
Date:   Mon, 29 Mar 2021 16:38:34 +0300
Message-Id: <20210329133836.2115236-9-mperttunen@nvidia.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.30.1
